{"type":"text","text":"If the computed contrast ratio between two given colors meets the 3:1 requirement"}]},"doc://MISOFoundations/documentation/MISOFoundations/MISOWCAG21Ratio":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOWCAG21Ratio","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOFoundations\/documentation\/MISOFoundations\/MISOWCAG21Ratio","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOWCAG21Ratio","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Some countries set up new laws so as to force companies to have a better accessibility of their digital services."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is for example the case for France with the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"also named “RGAA”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The WCAG specifications, for AA level, defines a contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for textual elements (i.e. texts), and 3:1 for non-textual elements (i.e. link’s chevron)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However it is higly recommended for mobile devices to reach AAA level because of the screen sizes and luminosity issues, i.e. 7:1 for textual"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and 4.5:1 for non-textual elements."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This utility helps to define whether a set of contrast ratio matches AA and AAA or not."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"See for example "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"url":"\/documentation\/misofoundations\/misowcag21ratio","type":"topic","title":"MISOWCAG21Ratio"},"ic_layers.png":{"identifier":"ic_layers.png","type":"image","alt":null,"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/MISOFoundations\/ic_layers.png"}]},"https://accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr":{"identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr","type":"link","url":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr","title":"Référentiel Général d’Amélioration de l’Accessibilité","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Référentiel Général d’Amélioration de l’Accessibilité","type":"text"}]},"https://system.design.orange.com/0c1af118d/p/2531b9-accessibility-compliance":{"identifier":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance","type":"link","url":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance","title":"the following guidelines","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"the following guidelines"}]},"doc://MISOFoundations/documentation/MISOFoundations":{"type":"topic","title":"Foundations","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Contains a set of helpers and extensions shared for higher level targets."}],"images":[{"identifier":"ic_layers.png","type":"icon"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/misofoundations","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOFoundations\/documentation\/MISOFoundations"}}}